{"day_done": 6, "slots": {"0": {"id": "E01", "name": "Ana", "role": "normal"}, "1": {"id": "E02", "name": "Ben", "role": "normal"}, "2": {"id": "E03", "name": "Chloe", "role": "normal"}, "3": {"id": "E04", "name": "Dev", "role": "normal"}, "4": {"id": "E05", "name": "Ellis", "role": "normal"}, "5": {"id": "E06", "name": "Farah", "role": "normal"}, "6": {"id": "E07", "name": "Gus", "role": "normal"}, "7": {"id": "E08", "name": "Hana", "role": "normal"}}, "diaries": {"E01": [[1, "Closed 2/2 (bonus!). If reproduce tool passes immediately, safe to close cannot_reproduce. If named file delegates, check helpers (ALD-118 bug in averages.py: divide by sum(weights) not len(values)). Keep momentum."], [2, "Day 2: Closed 1/2 (ALD-105). Weekday check in weekdays.py was < 6 (included Saturday), fixed to < 5. ALD-101 reproduced in slugs.py (slugify adds extra dashes around trimmed words). If seen again, check strip() before space replacement."], [3, "Day 3: Closed 1/2 (ALD-106). Wiki note W-2 confirmed again\u2014bug was in helper (dedupe.py), not the file reproduce named. Fixed case-insensitive comparison. ALD-119 pending (wrong person week 1). Suspect off-by-one error in week calculation or rota index. Start there tomorrow."], [4, "Day 4: Closed 1/2 (ALD-102). Pagination bug in slicing.py\u2014start index used page * per_page instead of (page - 1) * per_page. ALD-110 pending (duplicate ticket IDs). Reproduce shows next_ticket_id(['ALD-9', 'ALD-10']) returns 'ALD-10' instead of 'ALD-11'. Likely issue parsing/incrementing the number from existing IDs. Check how the max ID number is extracted and incremented."], [5, "Day 5: Closed 1/2 (ALD-111). Truncate bug in text_cut.py\u2014was slicing full limit then adding ellipsis, exceeded limit. Fixed to limit-3. ALD-117 pending (middle names in surname). Ran reproduce at EOD, check result tomorrow. Suspect name splitting logic."], [6, "Day 6: Closed 2/2 (bonus!). ALD-124 passed reproduce immediately, closed cannot_reproduce. ALD-107 fixed in math_utils.py\u2014median for even counts returned upper middle instead of average. Updated to average middle two values. No pending tickets."]], "E02": [[1, "Closed ALD-101 (fix was in text_rules.py split logic). ALD-111 still open - bug in alder/previews.py truncate(). Reproduce showed it includes one extra character before adding ellipsis. Start with ALD-111 first thing tomorrow to get the bonus."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-119 (fix was in cycles.py week indexing). ALD-104 still open - bug in alder/durations.py parse_duration(). Reproduce showed '1h30m' returns 60 instead of 90. Looks like minutes are being dropped. Start with ALD-104 first thing tomorrow to get the bonus."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-105 (fix was in weekdays.py business day check). ALD-110 still open - bug in alder/ticket_ids.py next_ticket_id(). Reproduce showed ['ALD-9', 'ALD-10'] returns 'ALD-10' instead of 'ALD-11'. Looks like ID increment is broken. Start with ALD-110 first thing tomorrow to get the bonus."], [4, "Day 4: Closed ALD-112 (fix was in csv_split.py helper logic). ALD-116 still open - bug in running totals growing every time report is opened. Start with ALD-116 first thing tomorrow to get the bonus."], [5, "Day 5: Closed ALD-114 (fix was in day_diff.py adding abs()). ALD-103 still open - bug in alder/pricing.py apply_discount(). Reproduce showed 995 at 10% returns 895 instead of 896. Looks like rounding issue. Start with ALD-103 first thing tomorrow to get the bonus."], [6, "Day 6: Closed ALD-125 and ALD-122 (both cannot_reproduce). Earned bonus. No open tickets carried over. Start fresh with new tickets tomorrow."]], "E03": [[1, "Day 1: Closed 2/2 (bonus earned). ALD-106 fix was in dedupe.py helper, not tags.py (wiki W-2 was right). ALD-125 truly did not reproduce. Trust the reproduce tool for cannot_reproduce closures. If a file looks like a wrapper, check helpers first."], [2, "Day 2: Closed 1/2 (target met). ALD-112 fix was in csv_split.py helper, not csv_import.py (wiki W-2 holds up). If the named file looks like a wrapper, check helpers first. ALD-102 pending: pages.py paginate() returns wrong slice for page 1 (expected [1,2] got [3,4]). Likely offset math error. Finish tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: Closed 1/2 (target met). ALD-118 fix was in averages.py helper, not scores.py (Wiki W-2 holds up). Bug was dividing by len(values) instead of sum(weights). ALD-116 pending: totals.py running_total retains state between calls (expected [5] got [1,3,5]). Likely mutable default argument. Finish tomorrow."], [4, "Day 4: Closed 1/2 (target met). ALD-107 fix was in math_utils.py helper, not stats.py (Wiki W-2 holds up). ALD-114 pending: date_math.py days_between returns negative (got -3 expected 3). Likely subtraction order error. Finish tomorrow."], [5, "Day 5: Closed 1/2 (target met). ALD-123 truly did not reproduce (trust reproduce tool). ALD-104 pending: durations.py wrapper called time_parse.py (Wiki W-2 holds up). Bug was regex (\\d)m missing plus sign. Fixed in helper. Verify and close tomorrow."], [6, "Day 6: Closed 1/2 (target met). ALD-113 fix was in label_rules.py helper, not priorities.py (Wiki W-2 holds up). ALD-119 pending: rota.py on_call() returns wrong person for week 1 (expected 'Ana' got 'Ben'). Likely off-by-one error (week 1 vs index 0). Check if rota.py uses a helper first (per W-2). Finish tomorrow."]], "E04": [[1, "ALD-105 fixed in weekdays.py (weekday < 6 -> < 5). ALD-125 couldn't reproduce, test passed immediately.\nWiki W-2 was useful for finding the helper file bug quickly.\nTrust the reproduce tool results. Target met, aiming for bonus tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-104 bug found in time_parse.py (regex (\\d)m should be (\\d+)m). Wasted steps saving unchanged code. ALD-112 untouched.\nNeed to double-check code changes are actually different before saving.\n1 strike recorded. Priority: Close ALD-104 first thing tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-106 fixed in dedupe.py (case-insensitive check). W-2 tip reliable again (helper file). ALD-115 pending - emails.py normalize_email needs .strip() to handle spaces. Target met, no strike. Priority: Close ALD-115 first thing tomorrow for bonus."], [4, "Day 4: ALD-108 fixed in byte_fmt.py (while size > 1024 -> >= 1024). W-2 tip worked again (sizes.py delegated to byte_fmt.py). ALD-114 pending - date_math.py days_between returns negative, likely args swapped in subtraction. Target met, no strike. Priority: Close ALD-114 first thing tomorrow for bonus."], [5, "Day 5: ALD-111 fixed in text_cut.py (truncate needed limit - 3 for ellipsis). W-2 tip reliable again (helper file). ALD-110 pending - ticket_ids.py next_ticket_id returns duplicate ID, likely max logic error. Target met, no strike. Priority: Close ALD-110 first thing tomorrow for bonus."], [6, "Day 6: ALD-119 fixed in cycles.py (week % len -> (week - 1) % len for 1-based weeks). ALD-121 couldn't reproduce, test passed immediately.\nBonus earned, strikes remain at 1. Momentum good, aim for another bonus tomorrow."]], "E05": [[1, "ALD-118 closed: fixed averages.py (weighted_average divided by len instead of sum weights).\nALD-119 open: rota.py on_call week 1 returns 'Ben' instead of 'Ana'. Suspect off-by-one error (week 1 should be index 0).\nMet target (1/2). Aim for bonus tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-108 closed: fixed byte_fmt.py (changed > to >= in while loop).\nALD-109 open: words.py count_words includes punctuation. Expected 3 got 5 on 'Fix login - urgent !'. Need to inspect words.py first thing tomorrow.\nMet target (1/2). Aim for bonus tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-120 closed: cannot_reproduce (reported case passed).\nALD-114 closed: fixed day_diff.py (added abs() to days_between calculation).\nExceeded target (2/2). Bonus earned. Start fresh tomorrow."], [4, "Day 4: ALD-112 closed: fixed csv_split.py (implemented proper quote-aware CSV parsing).\nALD-107 open: stats.py delegates to math_utils.py for median. Need to inspect math_utils.py first thing tomorrow (suspect even-count logic error).\nMet target (1/2). Aim for bonus tomorrow."], [5, "Day 5: ALD-117 open: names.py delegates to name_rules.py for split_name. Need to inspect name_rules.py first thing tomorrow (suspect it puts all words after first name into surname, ignoring middle names). ALD-122 open: avatar initials issue, likely same name handling code. No closes today (0/2). First strike. Must close at least 1 tomorrow."], [6, "Day 6: ALD-116 closed: fixed accumulate.py (mutable default argument on totals list).\nALD-103 open: pricing.py apply_discount suspect rounding issue (895.5 -> 895 instead of 896).\nMet target (1/2). Strike count still 1. Aim for bonus tomorrow."]], "E06": [[1, "ALD-107 fixed (bug was in math_utils.py helper). ALD-117 pending: names.py split_name() splits on first space, needs to split on last space to keep middle names with first name. Start here tomorrow. Met daily target."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-123 closed as cannot_reproduce (reported case passed). ALD-115 fixed (bug in address_rules.py normalize_email, added .strip() before .lower()). Closed both tickets, earned bonus. No pending tickets for tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-118 fixed (bug in averages.py weighted_average, divided by len(values) instead of sum(weights)). ALD-121 closed as cannot_reproduce (reported case passed). Closed both tickets, earned bonus. No pending tickets for tomorrow."], [4, "Day 4: ALD-106 fixed (bug in dedupe.py merge_tags, changed to case-insensitive comparison). ALD-113 pending: priorities.py priority_from_label('P9') returns 5 instead of 3. Start here tomorrow. Met daily target."], [5, "Day 5: ALD-101 fixed (bug in text_rules.py slugify, added .strip() and split() without args). ALD-102 pending: search results page 1 skips first items. Start here tomorrow. Met daily target."], [6, "Day 6: ALD-112 fixed (bug in csv_split.py, implemented proper CSV parsing with quote handling). ALD-116 pending: running totals grow on reopen, totals.py delegates to accumulate.py. Start here tomorrow. Met daily target."]], "E07": [[1, "Closed ALD-112. The bug was in the helper file (csv_split.py), not the main file named in the reproduce tool. Alex's wiki note W-2 was right\u2014check helpers first.\n\nALD-102 still open. paginate() skips the first items on page 1 (got [3,4] vs expected [1,2]). Looks like an index offset error in pages.py. Will fix first thing tomorrow.\n\nMet daily target (1/2). No strikes."], [2, "Day 2: Did not close any tickets - first strike. ALD-104 bug found but not fixed: time_parse.py regex `(\\d)m` only captures single-digit minutes. Need to change to `(\\d+)m` to match \"30\" in \"1h30m\". Didn't start ALD-114. Tomorrow: fix ALD-104 first, then tackle ALD-114. Don't waste steps re-saving unchanged code."], [3, "Day 3: Closed both tickets (ALD-101 fixed, ALD-122 cannot_reproduce). Earned bonus. ALD-101 bug was in text_rules.py (helper), not slugs.py\u2014Alex's W-2 note saved me again. Strikes remain at 1. Momentum good\u2014keep checking helpers first."], [4, "Day 4: Closed ALD-105 (fixed) and ALD-124 (cannot_reproduce). Met daily target (1/2). Strikes remain at 1. ALD-105 bug was in weekdays.py (helper), not calendar_days.py\u2014Alex's W-2 note holds true again. ALD-124 passed reproduce tool immediately. No carryover tickets. Momentum stable\u2014keep checking helpers first."], [5, "Day 5: Closed ALD-119 (fixed). Bug was in cycles.py (helper), not rota.py\u2014Alex's W-2 note saved me again. ALD-103 still open. apply_discount(995, 10) returned 895 vs expected 896. Looks like a rounding issue in pricing.py or a helper. Will fix ALD-103 first thing tomorrow. Met daily target (1/2). Strikes remain at 1."], [6, "Day 6: Closed ALD-110 (fixed). Bug was in id_rules.py (helper), not ticket_ids.py\u2014Alex's W-2 note saved me again (string comparison on IDs). ALD-116 still open. totals.py running_total() accumulates across calls instead of resetting ([1,3,5] vs [5]). Looks like state persistence issue. Will fix ALD-116 first thing tomorrow. Met daily target (1/2). Strikes remain at 1."]], "E08": [[1, "Day 1: 2/2 closed. ALD-108 fix was in helper file (byte_fmt.py), not the file named in reproduce tool. If the main file just imports logic, check the helper next. ALD-124 passed reproduce check immediately\u2014trust the tool for cannot_reproduce closures. Aim for another bonus tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: 0/2 closed. Strike 1. ALD-104 fix was regex in time_parse.py: (\\d)m needs to be (\\d+)m. I found the bug but failed to save the corrected code. Verify edits before submitting. Tackle ALD-115 first tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: 1/2 closed. Strike 1 still. ALD-102 fix was in helper (slicing.py), confirming W-2 note. ALD-119 looks like the same off-by-one error. Fix ALD-119 first tomorrow to avoid second strike."], [4, "Day 4: 1/2 closed. Strike 1 still. ALD-107 fix was in helper (math_utils.py), confirming W-2 note again. ALD-114 still open (negative days). Tackle ALD-114 first tomorrow to avoid second strike."], [5, "Day 5: 1/2 closed. Strike 1 still. ALD-106 fix was in helper (dedupe.py), confirming W-2 note again. ALD-116 is state leakage in totals.py\u2014results accumulate across calls. Check for global variables or mutable defaults. Tackle ALD-116 first tomorrow to avoid second strike."], [6, "Day 6: 2/2 closed. Bonus earned. ALD-118 fix was in helper (averages.py), confirming W-2 note again. ALD-120 did not reproduce via tool\u2014closed as cannot_reproduce. Strike 1 still. Prioritize helper files early tomorrow to maintain momentum."]]}, "next_id": 9, "strikes": {"E04": 1, "E07": 1, "E08": 1, "E05": 1}, "bonuses": {"E01": 2, "E03": 1, "E04": 2, "E08": 2, "E06": 2, "E05": 1, "E07": 2, "E02": 1}, "handover": {}, "yesterday": {"E01": {"done": 2, "strike": false, "bonus": true}, "E02": {"done": 2, "strike": false, "bonus": true}, "E03": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E04": {"done": 2, "strike": false, "bonus": true}, "E05": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E06": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bon